OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn overcast day with patchy
OL,6,Frain or showers across the region.
OL,7,FRain will be mostly drizzly but the
OL,8,Fodd heavier burst is possible. Misty
OL,9,Facross the Pennines. Light winds and
OL,10,Ffeeling cold.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy and damp start to the
OL,13,Fnight with some rain, before turning
OL,14,Fdrier later in the night, especially
OL,15,Facross northern areas. Light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FAny early rain affecting
OL,18,Fmore southern areas will clear
OL,19,Fsouthwards to leave a drier and
OL,20,Fincreasingly brighter day on Thursday.
OL,21,FFrost likely overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
